\f2\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::3>
\f1\b Scene job:
\f0\b0 \strokec2  Double back over the Sages\'92 Night Out and reveal that Alexander has been surveilling them. Establish that he is genuinely competent at investigation and surveillance, while showing how he builds an increasingly coherent\'97and increasingly wrong\'97story from real fragments. Begin the path that will eventually lead him to make Eloise the target of his final 
\f3\i Candid Criminal
\f0\i0 .\

\f1\b \strokec2 Opening leads:
\f0\b0 \strokec2 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Alexander is operating covertly again.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 He has become interested in the Sages because they are inexplicably embedded around Sarah and Project Kebab.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 He has followed them to the Greek venue without their noticing.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 His surveillance setup should demonstrate competence rather than gadget comedy.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Because the reader has already seen the evening directly, do not simply replay it. Alexander receives selected views, fragments and gaps.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 \strokec2 What Alexander correctly observes:
\f0\b0 \strokec2 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Sages know about the five-disc configuration and the message.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 They disagree about what the Kebab results mean.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Solo is wary of treating what they have observed as an instruction.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Sarah matters to whatever they are discussing.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Johnny matters too.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 They discuss whether somebody should approach Johnny.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Their disagreement becomes serious enough to require the peculiar wrestling settlement.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 None of that needs to be falsified for the joke.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 \strokec2 Where the comedy begins:
\f0\b0 \strokec2 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Alexander is very good at connecting evidence.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 He is less good at recognising when the evidence does 
\f1\b not
\f0\b0  belong to a single coherent plan.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Sages\'92 shorthand looks like secrecy.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Their uncertainty looks like coded disagreement.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Their access to Kebab looks like infiltration.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Their argument over approaching Johnny looks like selection of an operative.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The wrestling looks considerably more significant in surveillance footage than it actually was.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 His deductions should remain plausible enough that the reader can see why he makes them.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 \strokec2 Pressure progression:
\f0\b0 \strokec2 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Alexander gets ordinary surveillance material and patiently works through it.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Apparently meaningless fragments begin connecting with things he already knows about Sarah, Kebab and Sublime Point.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 He realises the Sages are much more involved in Kebab than their lack of official role suggests.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Their private discussion establishes that they are contemplating some form of intervention involving Johnny.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Alexander starts treating their ambiguity as deliberate concealment.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	6	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 He asks the useful investigative question: 
\f1\b who gave these men this much access?
\f0\b0 \
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	7	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 That question begins moving his attention away from the Sages themselves and towards the structure around them.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	8	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Sublime Point, Kebab, Sarah\'92s presence there, the engineers and the Sages\'92 extraordinary freedom all sit inside Eloise\'92s domain.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	9	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Alexander does 
\f1\b not yet conclude that Eloise is the villain
\f0\b0 , but she becomes impossible to leave outside his developing theory.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 \strokec2 Alexander handling:
\f0\b0 \strokec2 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Competent, patient, observant.\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 He should notice things other characters may have ignored.\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 He knows how to identify footage that will later work on television.\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Do not make him credulous or stupid.\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 His flaw is narrative appetite: once several true facts begin forming a story, he increasingly prefers the story to unresolved ambiguity.\
\ls5\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Ideally he corrects somebody else\'92s cruder misunderstanding before making a subtler, larger mistake himself.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 \strokec2 Relationship to the previous scene:
\f0\b0 \strokec2 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The reader has more context than Alexander.\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 That makes some of his conclusions funny.\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 But Alexander should also extract implications the reader may not have consciously assembled.\
\ls6\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The second telling therefore advances the plot rather than merely parodying the first.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 \strokec2 Path towards Eloise:
\f0\b0 \strokec2 \uc0\u8232 This scene only needs to establish the first step:\

\f1\b \strokec2 The Sages are not freelancing around the margins of Sublime Point. Somebody with power has allowed them to be there.
\f0\b0 \strokec2 \
Later developments\'97Sarah being confined, Kebab continuing, Chip being removed, Eloise\'92s prior Gyges work\'97can progressively turn Alexander\'92s suspicion into his 
\f3\i Candid Criminal
\f0\i0  thesis:\

\f1\b \strokec2 Mother did not merely permit the conspiracy. Mother runs it.
\f0\b0 \strokec2 \
That conclusion can be wrong in important ways while resting on an impressive quantity of true evidence.\

\f1\b \strokec2 Endpoint:
\f0\b0 \strokec2 \uc0\u8232 Alexander has enough to know he has a story, but not yet what the story is.\
The important change is that his investigation no longer ends with the Sages. It now points 
\f1\b \strokec2 upwards
\f0\b0 \strokec2 .\

